SUMMARY:Sunday Live Music: MICHAEL NORRIS
DESCRIPTION:Michael Norris is a Bloomington\, Indiana based singer/songwriter. Pulling inspiration from a very large range of genres. Most would describe his performances as a blend of americana/folk/country/pop with a little bit of soul.
URL:https://butlerwinery.com/event/sunday-live-music-michael-norris-2/
