SUMMARY:Sunday Live Music: SOTTO VOCE
DESCRIPTION:The Sotto Voce Jazz Quintet focuses on the music of the Great American Songbook\, with the music of Cole Porter\, Hoagy Carmichael\, George Gershwin\, Duke Ellington\, and other familiar 20th Century composers. “Sotto Voce” in Italian means “Subdued Voice”\, and the quintet aims to provide familiar tunes in a comfortable aural setting. The quintet is comprised of experienced local players: Angie Aumage on vocals and guitar\, Rich Pierce on guitar\, Paulo Dias on piano\, Randy Gratz on bass\, and Dave Shank on drums.
URL:https://butlerwinery.com/event/sunday-live-music-sotto-voce-2/
END:VEVENT
